{"id":"vod_md_2332","vodId":"2332","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"食梦者玛利","name_cn":"食梦者玛利","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230813-1/7ed831f6f8dd3c181ec605a7179524e7.jpg"},"summary":"表面看来，藤原梦路（冈本信彦 配音）不过是一介平凡少年，然而，他却隐藏了一个不为人知的的秘密——每天夜晚，他都会遭到噩梦的纠缠，并且，梦路拥有能够预知他人梦境的特殊能力，能够通过观察人们周身所散发出的颜色来判断梦境，尽管准确率很低，但到底算是与众不同。某日，梦路惊讶的发现，噩梦中的场景竟然蔓延到了现实之中，正当他处于惊恐之中手足无措时，一位名叫玛利（佐仓绫音 配音）的神秘少女出现并救了他，之后，外冷内热的天使安琪（远藤绫 配音）、天真烂漫的帕蒂（后藤沙绪里 配音）、邪恶腹黑的米斯特汀（矢作纱友里 配音）接连出现在了梦路的身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-13 08:55:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/ADFDMxK6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/m8yBj9rK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/rGeDKyEb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/BZfJFHZL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/cPknYcpr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/bESUu3GK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/RodUGil4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/fuTnxDO1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/0AU6GzNq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/57zcx8Yu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/PklNl1sd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/jMyyRORZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/93lga5Eh/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:18.612Z"}